sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Sender browser
    participant WS as Shared STOMP /ws
    participant BE as Messaging typing service
    participant DB as MySQL read-only check
    participant B as Recipient browser

    A->>WS: SEND /app/messaging/typing<br/>{conversationId, typing: true}
    WS->>BE: Principal users.id + payload
    BE->>BE: Rate limit 4 frames/user/second
    BE->>DB: Check USER/ACTIVE/profile, membership and two-way Block
    DB-->>BE: recipient user id
    BE->>WS: convertAndSendToUser(recipient, /queue/messaging)
    WS-->>B: TYPING_STARTED (no unreadCount)
    B->>B: Show aria-live indicator and reset 5-second expiry

    alt idle 2 seconds, submit, blank, blur or leave
        A->>WS: SEND {conversationId, typing: false}
        WS->>BE: Principal users.id + payload
        BE->>DB: Repeat visibility check
        DB-->>BE: recipient user id
        BE->>WS: recipient-only TYPING_STOPPED
        WS-->>B: Clear typing indicator
    else STOP frame is lost
        B->>B: Expiry clears stale indicator after 5 seconds
    end

    Note over A,B: Typing is ephemeral: no DB write, Notification, unread, replay or after-commit event
